  "description": "Conext CL three-phase PV inverter (18/20/25 kVA, E and NA models) with Modbus RTU and Modbus TCP: identity, energy, AC and PV measurements, temperatures, state and alarms, event log, active and reactive power control, relay and the SunSpec models",
